This repository contains the independently deployable account and route-backup
server prepared for the Route Player Android application.

The application project is based on GPS Locator by 0xfnzero:
https://github.com/0xfnzero/gps-locator
Baseline commit: 21ee0419ca4bcc7b2a32e9bb2108fbecd624e9f7

The original MIT license and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.
The Android app, its dependencies, and the legacy anonymous cloud-server are
not included in this server-only repository.
